# Academics Exam Maker (compact)

The **only** exam-maker UI in this repo. Route: `/academics/settings/exam-maker-compact`. Component: `AcademicExamMakerMinimalPage.jsx`. Nav label: “Exam Maker” in `AcademicLayout.jsx`.

Uses **`AcademicContext`** only (not campus `AppDbContext`). Auth: `AcademicProtectedRoute` + JWT via `academicApi` (`localStorage.academicToken`). Policy: `AcademicsOnly` on `ExamMakerController`.

The removed full-page exam maker (`AcademicExamMakerPage.jsx`) must not be reintroduced; extend the compact page or shared helpers instead.

