## API surface (used by compact UI)

Base: `GET|POST /api/academics/exammaker/...` via `academicExamMakerService.js`.

| Method | Path | FE function | Used by compact? |
|--------|------|-------------|------------------|
| GET | `question-pool?classId&subjectId&search&type&category&take` | `getExamQuestionPool` | Yes (search required) |
| POST | `create-from-selection` | `createAcademicExamPaperFromSelection` | Yes |
| POST | `papers/{id}/from-selection` | `updateAcademicExamPaperFromSelection` | Yes (**POST only** — Plesk blocks PUT) |
| GET | `papers` | `getAcademicExamPapers` | Yes |
| GET | `papers/{id}` | `getAcademicExamPaperById` | Yes |
| POST | `papers/{id}/print-adjustments` | `updateAcademicExamPaperPrintAdjustments` | Yes (preview **Save print layout**) |
| POST | `generate` | `generateAcademicExamPaper` | **No** (blueprint auto-pick; legacy) |

Response envelope: `response.data.data` (ApiResponse wrapper).

### `CreateExamPaperFromSelectionRequestDto` (save payload)

```json
{
  "classId", "subjectId", "schoolName", "schoolLogoUrl",
  "examTitleId", "paperName", "sessionLabel", "examType",
  "headerNote", "instructions", "footerNote",
  "showSectionNames", "subQuestionNumberingStyle", "wrapQuestionMarksInParentheses",
  "durationMinutes",
  "chapterIds": [],  // compact sends omitted/empty
  "selectedQuestions": [{ "questionId", "questionOrder", "marks", "section" }],
  "sections": [{ "sectionKey", "sectionName", "headingText", "instructionText", "marksDisplayText", "optionalQuestionsEnabled", "optionalQuestionsAttemptCount" }],
  "printAdjustments": { "headerNote", "footerNote", "sections", "questions", "spacing" }  // optional; persisted on QuestionPaper.PrintAdjustmentsJson
}
```

### `ExamPaperDto` (load/save response)

Includes `questions[]` with catalog fields + `order`, `section`, `marks`; `sections[]` deserialized from `SectionMetaJson`; `printAdjustments` from `PrintAdjustmentsJson` (full detail on GET by id / save responses; omitted on list).

