## Refactoring guidance

**Prefer extracting hooks**, not a second page:

- `useExamPaperForm`, `useQuestionPool`, `usePaperPreload`, `useSectionConfigs`
- Keep `examPaperPrintHelpers.js` for anything shared with print/PDF later
- Keep save payload builder in one function mirroring `CreateExamPaperFromSelectionRequestDto`

**Do not**:

- Use `axios.put` for paper updates (use POST `papers/{id}/from-selection`).
- Split catalog and paper into separate routes without updating preload/slot logic.
- Assume pool loads without search text.
- Add campus `AppDbContext` or `X-Campus` to these calls.

**When changing slot uniqueness**: update `getPaperKey` / `findMatchingPaper` / `normalizePaperName` (FE), `FindPaperIdBySlotAndNameAsync` (BE), SQL in `docs/academics_exam_maker_paper_name_unique.sql`, and document in this rule.

**When adding fields**: add column + `docs/academics_exam_maker_mw.sql` snippet, entity `QuestionPaper`, DTOs, service mapping, `form` + Paper setup modal + `hydratePaperInEditor` + save payload.

**Print layout persistence**: `QuestionPaper.PrintAdjustmentsJson` (migration `AddQuestionPaperPrintAdjustmentsJson`). FE `printTweaks` ↔ `printAdjustments` via `examPaperPrintAdjustments.js`. Run **School.Migrator `--academic-only`** after deploy.

**Testing checklist**:

- New objective paper → save → reload via dropdown change / Papers modal
- Same slot subjective vs objective as separate papers; same title/type with different paper names as separate papers
- Save again updates (not duplicate) for same slot + paper name
- New exam with new paper name creates a second objective paper for same class/subject/title
- Search catalog with class+subject set
- Print preview: MCQ options, LAQ marks column, roman/numeric/alpha labels
- SAQ/LAQ section: optional “attempt any N” → instruction + marks summary + saved total marks
- Plesk: confirm updates use POST

